{"4177830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Life of a Cockroach", "steam_appid": 4177830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4748090], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/feb974b9de425238d17e7a336b3e5a13.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/feb974b9de425238d17e7a336b3e5a13.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/feb974b9de425238d17e7a336b3e5a13.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO LIFE OF A COCKROACH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it would be like to leave everything behind and become a cockroach? Of course you have! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some disgusting, for others simply insignificant, put yourself in the place of this insect and experience what it really feels like to be one of them. Climb walls, fly, search for food, fight for your life by fleeing from danger or hiding, the world now has no barriers for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/0ee3171a12bad23bf6551d8c9eebe453.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/0ee3171a12bad23bf6551d8c9eebe453.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/0ee3171a12bad23bf6551d8c9eebe453.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cockroach, you have no powers; you can't even attack those who want to hurt you. In this adventure, you'll have to find a way to survive by your own means in a hostile urban world where you're just a gross meaningless bug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/a155a8363a9b5c461955f79a6e84315a.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/a155a8363a9b5c461955f79a6e84315a.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/a155a8363a9b5c461955f79a6e84315a.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the city and every single location from a different perspective in an open world. Move freely both vertically and horizontally and reach secret places. Several locations, interiors full of hidden corners, and huge outdoor areas—every place hides its secrets, and it's up to you to discover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/6ab12f891eba394027abdd0a59269584.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/6ab12f891eba394027abdd0a59269584.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/6ab12f891eba394027abdd0a59269584.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with other bugs in different locations around the city, complete the tasks and challenges they ask of you, and discover their stories. Each insect has a story to tell you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/5ccb4872012ba968b1f0d64477e46ede.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/5ccb4872012ba968b1f0d64477e46ede.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/5ccb4872012ba968b1f0d64477e46ede.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to use each of your skills to get the most out of them, complete tasks, survive, and accumulate experience points to improve your flight, speed, climbing, health, or decrease your appetite. In this adventure, you choose how to act at every moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/e9956205686199403eb0900de006564a.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/e9956205686199403eb0900de006564a.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/e9956205686199403eb0900de006564a.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/feb974b9de425238d17e7a336b3e5a13.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/feb974b9de425238d17e7a336b3e5a13.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/feb974b9de425238d17e7a336b3e5a13.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO LIFE OF A COCKROACH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it would be like to leave everything behind and become a cockroach? Of course you have! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some disgusting, for others simply insignificant, put yourself in the place of this insect and experience what it really feels like to be one of them. Climb walls, fly, search for food, fight for your life by fleeing from danger or hiding, the world now has no barriers for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/0ee3171a12bad23bf6551d8c9eebe453.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/0ee3171a12bad23bf6551d8c9eebe453.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/0ee3171a12bad23bf6551d8c9eebe453.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cockroach, you have no powers; you can't even attack those who want to hurt you. In this adventure, you'll have to find a way to survive by your own means in a hostile urban world where you're just a gross meaningless bug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/a155a8363a9b5c461955f79a6e84315a.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/a155a8363a9b5c461955f79a6e84315a.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/a155a8363a9b5c461955f79a6e84315a.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the city and every single location from a different perspective in an open world. Move freely both vertically and horizontally and reach secret places. Several locations, interiors full of hidden corners, and huge outdoor areas—every place hides its secrets, and it's up to you to discover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/6ab12f891eba394027abdd0a59269584.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/6ab12f891eba394027abdd0a59269584.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/6ab12f891eba394027abdd0a59269584.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with other bugs in different locations around the city, complete the tasks and challenges they ask of you, and discover their stories. Each insect has a story to tell you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/5ccb4872012ba968b1f0d64477e46ede.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/5ccb4872012ba968b1f0d64477e46ede.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/5ccb4872012ba968b1f0d64477e46ede.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to use each of your skills to get the most out of them, complete tasks, survive, and accumulate experience points to improve your flight, speed, climbing, health, or decrease your appetite. In this adventure, you choose how to act at every moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/e9956205686199403eb0900de006564a.poster.avif?t=1786998425\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/e9956205686199403eb0900de006564a.webm?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/extras/e9956205686199403eb0900de006564a.mp4?t=1786998425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Yes, you’re a cockroach, so your top priority now is to survive. Explore an urban environment from a whole new perspective in this open-world 3D adventure filled with challenges, tasks, and dangers. Discover hidden places, master your skills, and become the ultimate survivor insect!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/d91b779550c7d41cdd8b01e4db0c3737e08da1e8/header.jpg?t=1786998425", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/b0206799dea0022eb1408a0c48f3491fd8ffe683/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786998425", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/b0206799dea0022eb1408a0c48f3491fd8ffe683/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786998425", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 8400 / Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 950 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 9600 / AMD Ryzen 7 4800 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["CampeOn"], "publishers": ["CampeOn"], "demos": [{"appid": 4748090, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/84d8028fbf617cd4630b3c8dc18b46e3ef05b0a4/ss_84d8028fbf617cd4630b3c8dc18b46e3ef05b0a4.600x338.jpg?t=1786998425", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/84d8028fbf617cd4630b3c8dc18b46e3ef05b0a4/ss_84d8028fbf617cd4630b3c8dc18b46e3ef05b0a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786998425"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/9d1513c997fd7f85eff0b5f7cb55308863e67143/ss_9d1513c997fd7f85eff0b5f7cb55308863e67143.600x338.jpg?t=1786998425", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/9d1513c997fd7f85eff0b5f7cb55308863e67143/ss_9d1513c997fd7f85eff0b5f7cb55308863e67143.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786998425"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177830/03fcdb52dbc144f3aabbc337b19adb010215d978/ss_03fcdb52dbc144f3aabbc337b19adb010215d978.